# The first meal, the Prologue's Scene 5 (#186): the end of the first quest.
# Played by the SupperSpot (his round table) the moment you set the spicy
# tomato soup down by him while he's low. Your side is the replies you pick.
#
# He asks what it is, takes it in (clearing his low flag, which clears the
# bowl), lights up, rises and circles you. The captain, called down from the
# helm, looks in at the bunk room door, then goes back up to the wheel, where
# the deck talk finds him (#187).

~ start
@place player supper_seat
# He lives by your bunk (#206) and, low, can't float over by himself: he's
# at the table when the scene opens (a stand-in until the dinner bell).
@place lantern lantern_at_table
@shot supper_wide cut
@look lantern surprised
lantern: Oh! What's that?
@wait 0.6
lantern: Is that... for me?
- (Nod) -> you_made_it

~ you_made_it
lantern: You made that?
- (Nod again) -> never_had

~ never_had
@look lantern tired
lantern: Well, I...
@wait 1.0
lantern: I've never had soup before.
@shot lantern_table
@go lantern supper_bowl
@wait 1.8
@look lantern mended
clear lantern_low
set warmed_lantern
@wait 0.6
@look lantern pleased
lantern: Oh!
@shot supper_wide
@go lantern lantern_rises
@wait 1.0
lantern: Oh, that's much better!
@go lantern lantern_circle_1
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_circle_2
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_circle_3
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_circle_4
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_thanks
lantern: I feel wonderful!
@place heron doorway
@show heron
@face heron lantern
@shot doorway cut
@wait 0.6
heron: Well, I'll be.
@shot supper_wide
lantern: Look! Look at me!
heron: I can see.
lantern: They made me soup!
heron: Yes. I gathered that.
@face heron player
@send heron wheel
@wait 0.8
lantern: Thank you.
@wait 1.0
lantern: I remember you reaching for me.
lantern: I'm glad you did.
@home lantern
@shot free
-> END
